event: block
data: {"type": "text", "text": "Listed one-way: a cited document from GoodWe (ETR 50–125 kW) lists the pair; a cited document from GoodWe Battery Compatibility Overview does not. The GoodWe ETR 50–125 kW user manual (pp. 24–25) lists GW125K-ETR-G10 with GW208.9-BAT-LCD-G10 in its single-unit system table; pp. 26–27 repeat the pair for parallel systems, which require SEC3000C main program V7.8.19 or later. GoodWe's Battery Compatibility Overview (p. 6) does not name GW208.9-BAT-LCD-G10, so the manual's system table is not a complete warranty approval. GoodWe's Battery Compatibility Overview (p. 1) approves only the batteries it lists for connection under the GoodWe Limited Warranty. GW208.9-BAT-LCD-G10 is absent from its ETR 80–125 kW matrix on p. 6. GoodWe's Battery Compatibility Overview (p. 6) lists GW261.2-BAT-LCD-G10 in its ETR 80–125 kW column, and the GoodWe ETR 80–125 kW datasheet (EMEA, p. 2) names GW125K-ETR-G10 in that series. The GoodWe ETR 50–125 kW user manual (pp. 24–27) lists both models in its single-unit and parallel system tables; parallel systems require SEC3000C main program V7.8.19 or later. The datasheet (p. 3, footnote 4) requires a PV-string open-circuit input voltage above 813 V when this battery is connected.", "refs": ["p3595", "p1957", "p1958"]}

